+## Checkpoint REMEDIATION-02 — Audit findings remediation (2026-10-21)
+
+**TASK_ID:** REMEDIATION-02 — "KAWA_01 — Audit Findings Remediation", after an independent audit rejected the CLOSURE-01 closure
